<decision #parallel_xnl_authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" blocks = [] durable_candidate = false } (
  <question ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRQ>
  在最终切换前，完整的通用 XNL package 应如何暂存？
  </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRQ>
  <recommendation ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRR>
  Stage complete generic XNL packages under resources-xnl before the final cutover.
  </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRR>
  <options {  } [
    <option { key = "A" recommended = true } (
      <title ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRS>
      在 resources-xnl 下并行暂存完整 package
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRS>
      <description ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRT>
      The loader prefers manifest.xnl; a separate staging tree keeps the incomplete cutover from becoming authority.
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRT>
      <tradeoff ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRV>
      G7 must cut over the staged tree only after BO/PO convergence.
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRV>
    )>
    <option { key = "B" recommended = false } (
      <title ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRW>
      与当前 authority 同目录提前合并
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRW>
      <description ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRX>
      Co-locate the intentionally incomplete tree before the deferred BO/PO resources converge.
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRX>
      <tradeoff ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRY>
      Because the loader prefers manifest.xnl, this would hide deferred BO/PO resources.
      </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRY>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRZ>
    Stage complete generic XNL packages under resources-xnl before the final cutover.
    </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQRZ>
    <decision-text ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS0>
    Stage complete generic XNL packages under resources-xnl before the final cutover.
    </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS0>
    <rationale ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS1>
    The loader prefers manifest.xnl; co-locating an intentionally incomplete tree would hide deferred BO/PO resources.
    </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS1>
    <evidence ?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS2>
    G7 must cut over the staged tree only after BO/PO convergence.
    </?01M0TCTX0CHS8KDXYWKRP1VQS2>
  )>
)>
